<title>JAPAN: Ishihara Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ishihara Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.07		vs	    4.84</p>
<p> Operating	  438    million	  vs	  398    million</p>
<p> Current	    450    million	  vs	  409    million</p>
<p> Net		  234    million	  vs	  270    million</p>
<p> EPS		   30.01 yen	  vs	   34.64 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishihara Chemical Company Ltd is a surface-treatment agent manufacturer.</p>
</text>
